  "slug": "savory-mango-guacamole",
  "name": "Savory Mango Guacamole",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This mango guacamole puts a twist on the traditional ingredients for a sweet and savory flavor. Try it on chips or slather it on any type of sandwich.",
